OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold morning, frosty inland.
OL,6,FBright, with wisps of cloud dimming
OL,7,Fthe sunshine at times, particularly
OL,8,Ffurther south. Cloudier still over the
OL,9,FPennines but dry. Fairly breezy,
OL,10,Fespecially over hills, adding to the
OL,11,Fcold feel of the day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe breeze will ease to bring
OL,14,Fa calm, dry and mostly clear night.
OL,15,FTemperatures will fall sharply to
OL,16,Fallow a widespread frost to develop,
OL,17,Fgenerally colder than on Saturday
OL,18,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
